    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahasi omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 28:1-27)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka o ikomi na gatano na kabere bw’okogaamba gwa Peka, mosinto o Remalia, Ahasi mosinto o Yotamu, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, agachaaka kogamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo ebere, ekero achagete kogamba, na akagaamba emiaka etano nomo agwo Yerusalemu. Ere takorete ayare amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene, Nyasae oye, buna Daudi sokoro yaye akorete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende akabwatia chinchera chi’abarwoti b’Abaisraeli. Boigo agasamba omwana oye omomura akaba ekeng’wanso, koreng’ana nogokora gw’okogechia okwo abanto b’ebisaku banarete gokora, bari’Omonene aseretie korwa ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo akarua ebing’wanso na agasambera ubani agwo aase aimokererete igoro, na igoro ase ebigoro, na inse ya kera omote omobese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Resini, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, na Peka, mosinto o Remalia, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, bakagenda korwania Yerusalemu, bakanaaria Ahasi, korende tibabua omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria Resini, omorwoti bw’Abasiiria akairania omochie o Elati ase Abasiiria ase ogoseria Abayuda korwa Elati. Magega y’ayio Abasiiria bagacha komenya Elati; nao bamenyete goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi agatoma abanto ase Tigilati‐Pileseri, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, agateeba: “Inche nomosomba oo, naende omwana oo. Inchuo ontoorie korwa ase okoboko kw’omorwoti bw’Abasiiria, na okw’omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, aba bachire kondwania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Ahasi akaimokia chifeta ne chitaabu, echio chianyorekanete ase enyomba y’Omonene, na ase chikungo chi’enyomba y’omorwoti, agachitoma chikaba ekeegwa ase omorwoti bw’Abaasuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti bw’Abaasuri akamwanchera, akagenda Damesiki, akayobua agoosa abanto b’aroro, akabaira gochia Kiri, agaita Resini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi omorwoti akagenda Damesiki koumerana na Tigilati‐Pileseri, omorwoti bw’Abaasuri, na ekero aroche egesasiimero kiarenge aroro, agatoma omogwekano bw’egesasiimero keria ase Uria Omokuani, akaorokia boronge kegima buna kiaroisetigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria Omokuani akaagacha egesasiimero koreng’ana nomogwekano oria Ahasi omorwoti amotomerete korwa Damesiki, agakeroisia ritang’ani Ahasi ataraika aroro korwa Damesiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti achete korwa Damesiki agakerora egesasiimero, akageika ang’e, akarua ekeng’wanso igoro yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarua ekeng’wanso kiaye ki’ogosaambwa, na okoruegwa kwaye kw’endagera, naende akaumora okoruegwa kwaye gw’ekenyugwa, na akanyororokeria amanyinga ’ebing’wanso bi’omorembe igoro ase egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na egesasiimero gi’etai kiarenge ase egati y’egesasiimero keria ekeyia na ase enyomba y’Omonene, agakebeeka ensemo ya sugusu y’egesasiimero keria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi omorwoti agachiika Uria Omokuani, akamoteebia: “Igoro ase egesasiimero keria ekenene asambere ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa kia mambia, na okoruegwa kw’endagera kwa mogoroba, na ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa ki’omorwoti, na okoruegwa kwaye kw’endagera, amo nebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa bi’abaanto bonsi b’ense eye, na okoruegwa kwabo kw’endagera amo nokw’ebinyugwa. Naende onyororokerie amanyinga onsi ay’ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa na ay’ebing’wanso binde igoro yaye. Korende egesasiimero keria gi’etai ogentigere indore inki ndagekorere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria Omokuani agakora ayio onsi buna Ahasi omorwoti amochiigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi omorwoti akabutora emetobwa y’ebibekerero bi’ebituba, akarusia ebituba korwa aroro, akarusia negetuba keria ekenene giaterekereretwe igoro ase emegwekano ye chiombe yaroisirie korwa ase etai akageterekerera inse aase atichire namagena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboeto bw’Egesona gi’Esabato bwatubire nekerama, obwo bwaagachire ase enyomba eria, na egesoero gia isiko ki’omorwoti, akabirusia korwa ase enyomba y’Omonene, ase engencho y’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi Ahasi akorete nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasi akaraara ase chisokoro chiaye chiararete, agatindekwa aase chiatindegetwe, ase Omochie o Daudi; na Hezekia, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogaamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
